      "statement": "Buyer-side (an AI data-center operator's own 10-K, FY2026): IREN names high-voltage transformers, low-voltage transformers and switchgear as single points of failure with estimated lead times of 16–72 weeks and rising, and high-voltage circuit breakers at 15–113 weeks; it attributes long, unpredictable lead times to capacity-constrained supply chains for AI infrastructure. Lead times are dated context, not attributes (L4). Mapping 'high voltage transformers' at its substations to tech:large_power_transformer is a modeling judgment (the 10-K gives no MVA rating).",
      "disproof_condition": "條件：IREN 下一份 10-K／10-Q 的風險因子把變壓器／斷路器交期改成明顯縮短，或不再列為單點故障的長交期設備。核查頻率：每季（IREN 10-Q／10-K）。觸發後 48 小時：e1、e2、e3 降 confidence，重讀 tech:large_power_transformer 的需求側。"
    }
  ]
